    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The stated recipe is Moonlight Gu fused with Whirlwind Gu. Fang Yuan calls this a common route among several ways to raise Moonlight Gu. Other routes on that same list produce Moonglow Gu, Moon Scar Gu, or Moon Raiment instead.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "moonline-fusion",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_moonscar_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Whirlwind Gu has no dedicated page on this site yet, so the fusion material stays named in prose only.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "moonline-fusion",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Qing Shu forces Wood Charm Gu and begins turning into a tree spirit, the text says Moonwhirl Gu on his body does not change, while Green Vine Gu, Pin Needle Gu, and vitality grass show signs of growth and gain power as wood attribute Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wood-charm-and-recipes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wood_charm_gu",
          "gu_green_vine_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, when Fang Yuan browses Gu Yue clan rank three recipes, most of those recipes do not suit him because they need Gu such as Moonwhirl or Moonscar Gu as the base.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wood-charm-and-recipes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_yue_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No named rank three product built from Moonwhirl Gu appears in those chapters.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wood-charm-and-recipes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
